window.products.push({"id":1049134,"name":"Kerjthu Coffee Mug Warmer, Smart Cup Warmer for Desk with Gravity-Induction & 3-Temperature Control, White Beverage Warmer for Coffee, Tea, Milk, Tea ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AS+NPaYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕Gravity-Induction & Safety Feature: Kerjthu coffee mug warmer has a weight sensor. It turns on automatically when a mug weighing at least 10 oz / 0.62lb is placed on it and shuts off automatically when you remove the mug. No need to worry about its safety, this auto on/ off function can prevent accidental activation by your pets. ☕3-Temperature Control & Touch Design: Kerjthu coffee warmer is provided with touch design that switches from temperature modes. Simply tap the button, you can keep your coffee, milk or tea warm at 120℉-130℉-140℉ (49℃-55℃-60℃). The coffee cup warmer will be your perfect in-home setup, enjoy a morning coffee with sunshine! ☕3.62 Inch Heating Area for Mugs: Kerjthu smart mug warmer maintains the ideal temperature at the first sip till the last sip. Glass, stainless steel and ceramic cup are available. Using a thin-wall and flat-bottom cup with a cover can achieve the best warming result. ☕Compact Design & Simple to Clean: Kerjthu coffee mug warmer has a compact design, it won't take up much space, which makes it suitable to place on your work table or end table. Simply clean it with a dry cloth. ☕Best Gift & Perfect Customer Service: Kerjthu beverage warmer will be a nice gift to your friends ,mother, father etc.on Birthday, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving day and Christmas Day. We are committed to provide you with perfect service,welcome to contact us when you need any help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AS+NPaYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kerjthu","source_asin":"B09JKZW7Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JKZW7Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JKZW7Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
