window.products.push({"id":1049175,"name":"Tea Kettle - HIHUOS 2.8QT Whistling Kettle Stovetop - Stainless Steel Teapot for Stove Top with Heat Proof Ergonomic Handle, Elegance Vintage Tea Pots","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gLRrYDJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️【NEW ICON FOR YOUR KITCHEN】- Abandoning traditional shapes, HIHUOS stovetop tea kettle combines modern design to bring the ultimate brewing experience. The pumpkin texture on the exterior is forged through multiple processes, which is exquisite and ingenious. The collision of the woodgrain handle and the stainless steel body shows individuality in your kitchen, and it is also the best choice as a gift for friends or family members. ☑️【 PREMIUM MATERIAL FOR FAST BOILING】- This tea kettle for stove top is built with food-grade 18/8 stainless steel body and coated with a heat-resistant paint finish, which is not rust-resistant and corrosion-resistant. The teapot is designed with a 5-layer composite bottom, which has better thermal conductivity and faster heating, and shortening waiting time. This stainless steel kettle compatible with all types of stoves, including induction, gas, electric, halogen and radiant stoves. ☑️【ENGINEERED FOR SAFETY AND CONVENIENCE】- The stainless steel tea kettle will automatically emit a loud but not harsh whistle when water is boiled. You can enjoy happy moments while boiling water, reducing safety hazards. The bakelite handle features heat protection technology that cools down quickly to ensure you can handle the teakettle with your bare hands. (🌟Tips: Make sure to keep the lid closed when working. Don't handle it immediately after boiling, recommended to wait for 2 minutes.) ☑️【WELL-BUILT STOVETOP KETTLE】- MAX BOILING CAPACITY: 2.2QT, which can meet the tea drinking needs of the whole family without frequent boiling. The whistling tea kettle built-in easy-pour trigger opening mechanism allows you to brew tea with one hand, and the soft-touch handle provides a sturdy grip while pouring. Plus the wide opening makes filling and cleaning a breeze. We also provide a FREE SILICONE MAT to protect your countertops. ☑️【GREAT VALUE FOR YOUR MONEY】- HIHUOS modern tea pots for stovetop provide you with a pleasant brewing and serving experience and are the first choice for your home decoration. You are our top priority, if you need assistance with the product, please contact us immediately and we will resolve your issues to your satisfaction. In addition, we provide a full year of warranty. ❗❗❗【MATTERS NEED ATTENTION】- Since our tea kettle stovetop is made of stainless steel, A HIGH FIRE can overheat it and make it impossible to touch directly, and even cause the paint to peel off. To protect the kettle, it is recommended to use low to medium heat when boiling water to ensure a longer lifespan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gLRrYDJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIHUOS","source_asin":"B0BBLVRJ3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLVRJ3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLVRJ3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
