window.products.push({"id":1049184,"name":"Perfect Sleep Pad - Hydro-Based Cooling and Heating Mattress Pad - A Drug-Free Natural Sleep Aid for Hot Flashes, Night Sweat, Menopause, Insomnia, Hy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":637.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mEwwnsMvS._AC_.jpg","description":"Memory Foam PERFECT SLEEP PAD: This premium, climate-controlled, heating cooling mattress pad will make your bed into the ideal sleeping environment. Our Perfect Sleep Pad seamlessly fits on your current mattress for exceptional sleep and year-round comfort. This chilled mattress topper is the perfect solution for an overheated memory foam mattress, or any memory foam topper. Start sleeping cool with this revolutionary heating and cooling sleep pad. SINGLE ZONE HYDRO-BASED HEATING AND COOLING: Perfect Sleep Pad’s single temperature zone allows you to control the climate of your mattress with a click of a button. Unlike other heating and cooling pads, our deluxe water-based system doesn’t generate EM radiation, ensuring a constant, comfortable sleep environment. It fits single, twin, twin xl and double size beds. Don't waste electricity with fans that barely affect the temperature of your mattress. SUPPORTS REM AND RESTORATIVE SLEEP: Better, deeper sleep starts with regulating your body’s internal temperature. Perfect Sleep Pad’s constant climate technology helps maintain homeostasis so you can experience healthier, more restful sleep. This mattress cooling technology can help reduce hot flashes in menopausal adults and is the number one sleep helper for adults in the world. There is no other menopause cooling pad in the world as effective as the Perfect Sleep Pad cooled mattress pad REDUCES NIGHT SWEATS AND SOOTHES MUSCLES: Reduce nighttime sweating and rehab your muscles naturally overnight with Perfect Sleep Pad’s cool setting. Cryotherapy-style cooling prevents overheating and soothes your muscles while you sleep so you wake up feeling fresh and rejuvenated. Unlike the ebb sleep system, the chili cube by chili technology, and the chili pad sleep system, this water cooled mattress pad is the only cooling pad for sleeping with a temperature range from 46ºF to 118ºF 90-DAY COMFORT GUARANTEE: Your satisfaction is the most important to us. Sleep soundly knowing our Perfect Sleep Pad is backed by a 90-day comfort, full money-back guarantee. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed! If for any reason you are not fully satisfied with the purchase of The Perfect Sleep Pad and the natural sleep remedies it will provide, you are able to return it for a full refund of the purchase price. Start sleeping cool tonight with this cooled and heated mattress pad system.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mEwwnsMvS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PERFECT SLEEP PAD YOUR PERFECT SLEEP TEMPERATURE","source_asin":"B079KGS6T1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079KGS6T1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079KGS6T1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
