window.products.push({"id":1049521,"name":"Ann Clark Cookie Cutters Daisy Cookie Cutter, 3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qxucADKeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Family Owned Family owned and operated since 1989, Ann Clark Cookie Cutters (The Cookie Cutter People from Vermont) has grown from a small gift company to the largest manufacturer of cookie cutters in America.Soon after its launch the company became a family affair. Very supportive from the outset, Ann's late husband John became Vice-President in 1996. That same year her late son, John Jr., served as a key player when he moved back to Vermont and daughter Elizabeth joined up as Sales Manager. She has since moved on to other endeavors. Ann's son Ben came on board in 1998 and is now the company's CEO. Grandchildren Margaret, Rebecca and Alistair can be seen in company catalogs and also lend their services as cookie makers, tasters, and decorators. Made in the USA Made in the USA is an important label to us. We pride ourselves on our ability to manufacture high quality competitively priced cookie cutters using American made materials and workers. Every cookie cutter is made using certified metal from United States Steel Corporation. Our manufacturing team enjoys a happy and healthy place to work and the folks answering our phones are sitting right here in Vermont. As a customer, you can count on quality products that are consistently available and ship right away. You will know you've purchased our American made cookie cutter by the \"Made in the USA\" label on every product. Thank you for choosing our American made cookie cutters. Certified Safety Our cookie cutters meet safety requirements under California's Proposition 65 for lead and cadmium, CPSIA for lead, Bureau Veritas country of origin marking, and FDA - GRAS for metal intended to come into contact with food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qxucADKeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ann Clark Cookie Cutters","source_asin":"B00KYK5R1I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KYK5R1I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KYK5R1I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1049522,"name":"2 Pack Amber Glass Spray Bottles - 16 oz Mist & Stream Sprayer - Heavy Duty Brown Boston Round Bottle - Refillable Empty Containers for Essential Oils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VBugIrsKL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"GLASS SPRAY BOTTLE - Our solid Glass Spray Bottles are sturdy refillable empty spray bottles that's safe and environmentally friendly. It's perfect for essential oils, hand sanitizer, homemade cleaning product, perfumes, face toner & even acts as a spray dispenser for disinfecting any item/surface. Spray disinfectant onto towels and use it as disinfecting wipes. The aesthetically pleasing design of these bottles plus their durable quality makes it a great addition to your essential home supplies BPA-FREE, NON-TOXIC & FOOD SAFE SPRAY BOTTLE - Our food grade spray bottle is easy to wash and refill with edible liquid products. Plus, it even acts as a bbq spray bottle. This glass bottle is safe as it's lead-free. The white plastic trigger sprayer is 100% BPA-free, non toxic and easy to spray. Reduce the use of harmful plastic and toxic chemical exposure in your home with safe, eco friendly and reusable liquid mister IDEAL SIZE WITH 3 SETTINGS - The amber spray bottle is made to fit comfortably in the hand providing a stable grip when using it to clean, massage, spritz moisture, and mist house plants or face. You won’t have to constantly refill it as the glass bottle is big enough to hold a large amount of liquid product. Each bottle holds 2 cups or 16 ounces of liquid and features 3 settings: lightly mist, heavy stream, and off. The package includes 2x Amber Bottles, 2x Sprayer Heads, & 2x Bottle Caps ECO-FRIENDLY AND REUSABLE - These reusable spray bottles are efficient in preserving the quality of your products and reducing your carbon footprint. Unlike plastic bottles, glass bottles do not react with DIY cleaning ingredients or essential oil blends, ensuring longevity. You can reuse and refill these clear glass bottles without contaminating your liquid solutions. Keep yourself healthy and your home clean, safe, chemical-free, and environment-friendly. PERFECT GIFT SET- The classic build and fancy aesthetics of our glass spray bottles makes for a great gift for family and friends during birthdays, Christmas, father's day, mother's day and any celebratory occasion. Leakproof caps are also included to avoid spillage. The enduring quality of our glass bottle spray combo offers a blend of practicality, durability and sustainability. TeiKis also offers a LIFETIME WARRANTY & 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE for these 16oz glass spray bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VBugIrsKL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeiKis","source_asin":"B09L81SJ9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L81SJ9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L81SJ9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
