window.products.push({"id":1049624,"name":"Vegetables Steamer Basket for Cooking, Folding Veggie Steamer Insert Steaming Basket Expandable to fit Various Size Pot with Telescoping Removable Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5fvHEFDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"START MAKING STEAMED FOOD - The foldable steamer basket can be used to steam vegetables, seafood, eggs, meat, desserts, baby food and more. As an excellent food steamer, it can retain the nutrition and flavor of food. This stainless steel steamer is made of petals with holes, hot steam passes through the holes and cooks the food without touching boiling water. Mirror polishing makes you scratch-resistant and easy to clean during long-term use. Steaming is your healthier cooking choice. REMOVABLE & RETRACTABLE HANDLE - Upgrade veggie steamer basket with a retractable stainless steel T-shaped handle (about 3.3\"-6.5\"), you only need to rotate the thread to easily complete the installation. The extended T-shaped handle helps to insert the steamer into an even deeper pot and keep your hands away from the hot steam, which perfectly solves the problem of cooking large objects. You can rotate to remove the central handle to use the entire steaming basket to steam large items. DURABLE & FOLDABLE 3-LEG DESIGN - The vegetable steamer basket is made of food-grade stainless steel to ensure your health. The tripods are covered with silica gel to prevent the bottom of the pot and the table from being scratched. The three feet with a length of 1.2 inches can raise the steamer insert more stably, keep the food above the boiling water, and prevent the food from slipping, thereby more fully Absorb water vapor. After you use it, fold it up without taking up space. EXPANDABLE & COLLAPSIBLE DESIGN - You can easily open and close the steamer basket. Vegetable steamer basket collapsed diameter is 7.1 inches. It expands to 11 inches once petals are stretched out. The adjustable steamer for cooking fits well in pressure cooker, pots pans with 6, 8 quarts capacity. The metal steamer basket blades can be folded compactly so you can save storage space than large mesh steamer basket. The holes in the steamer are easy to drain. MULTIFUNCTIONAL & IDEAL GIFT - The steamer basket insert can be used to steam veggies, seafood, eggs, meats, desserts and much more. At the same time, Food steamer basket can steam vegetables , such as broccoli, carrots, corn, cauliflower, potatoes. The steamer can also be used as a fruit tray or filter. Dishwasher safe. Steamer packed in a beautiful box and is a holiday gift for family and friends. We provide after-sales service and money-back guarantee. Start enjoying risk-free shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5fvHEFDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puluru","source_asin":"B08DR8VCXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DR8VCXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DR8VCXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
