window.products.push({"id":1049644,"name":"Azptan Dining Room Chair Cushions,Seat Cushions for Kitchen Chairs,Chair Pads for Dining Cushions,Kitchen Chair Cushions with Ties（15.7\"X15.7\"）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gAvb-ZvzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KITCHEN CHAIR CUSHIONS WITH TIES】We learned that dining room chair cushions without anti-skid are very dangerous. One of the most important qualities of a dining chair cushion is its ability to stay in place during frequent usage, and lacing is an easy and thorough way to put a dining chair cushion on your chair, It can places a thick kitchen chair cushion on your dining chair once and for all. This soft and comfortable dining chair cushions with ties is an absolute must for all your chairs. 【RELIEVE HIP PRESSURE】Azptan dining chair cushion is filled with high-quality, thick and soft pearl cotton, pearl cotton is lighter than ordinary sponge, has excellent cushioning, shock resistance, not easy to deform, fluffy and the strong elasticity perfectly conforms to the contours of your buttocks. Sitting down makes you feel comfortable and relaxed and relieves pressure on your hips, tailbone, and lower back. 【PERFECT FOR DINING ROOM, KITCHEN, BEDROOM, PATIO, OFFICE, STUDY ROOM AND ANY INDOOR SEATING】The dining chair cushions come in a variety of sets, dirt-resistant fabric blues and browns are perfect for home decor. These kitchen chair cushions are square with curved corners and measure 15.7\" x 15.7\". These sizes are perfect for almost any dining room, kitchen, bedroom,living room,patio, office, study chair. 【RELIABLE DESIGN, PERFECT GIFT】The seat cushions for kitchen chairs stay absolutely in place, with hidden zippers, and the cushion covers are removable for separate use, and at 2.4 in thick, they provide just the right height and comfort. Can be used as dining room chair cushion, kitchen chair cushion, patio chair cushion, office chair cushion, car chair cushion, etc. Perfect for students' Homecoming, Birthdays, Halloween, Christmas and Housewarming etc. 【DURABLE, LONG LASTING, EASY TO CARE】The fashion patio chair square cushion with 4 middle buttons is fully tufted and each stitch is finely stitched to prevent fraying and clumping. Stain-resistant fabric, easy to care for, hand wash in cold water on localized soiled areas or remove the kitchen chair cushion cover and machine wash separately in cold water. Chair cushions should be thoroughly dry before being placed back on furniture or the floor. Do not bleach, do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gAvb-ZvzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azptan","source_asin":"B09Q61LB7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q61LB7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q61LB7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
