window.products.push({"id":1049662,"name":"iDOO Twin Air Mattress, Blue&White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qB7DiWZaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pvc ALL-NIGHT COMFORT AIR MATTRESS – Inflated dimensions of 74\" x 39\" x 18\". The 18” height makes it easier to get on or off. Made from a skin-friendly soft flocked top that creates a velvety surface, this air mattress built-in pump is just as stable and comfortable as a real bed. Provide your guests with an exceptional night's sleep. EXCEPTIONAL-STRONG SLEEPING SUPPORT - The Inflatable Twin mattress's inner construction is built with the latest tech. With 21 internal air coils for added durability so it supports up to 360 pounds. A raised edge prevents kids from unexpected falls while an anti-slip bottom keeps The mattress also won't tilt or flip if you sit on its edge or corner. 1-CLICK BUILT-IN PUMP AND EXTERNAL VALVE – Takes only 3 minutes to inflate and will stay inflated for days. The pump is also very quiet. The air mattress also features an external valve for use when camping. We are dedicated to providing high -quality products and 1-year manufacturer warranty with 100% satisfaction guarantee. LEAK-FREE WITH SAFE MATERIALS – 20% thicker eco-friendly PVC compared to traditional air bed surfaces. This air mattress features a flocked top and upgraded seams; it'll stay firm and airtight throughout the night. Materials are safe for the whole family. LIGHTWEIGHT FOR EASY STORAGE – The deflated compact size of 16” x 11.5” x 7” and only weighs10.8lbs! Folded up, the blow-up mattress is easily stored and convenient to take with you anywhere! Makes a great spare bed for your home, the beach, or camping trips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qB7DiWZaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDOO","source_asin":"B084SC9FJ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084SC9FJ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084SC9FJ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
