window.products.push({"id":1049666,"name":"ULUSERN Fluffy Comforter Cover Set,Purple Queen Size,Fuzzy Faux Fur Comforter Bed Set 3pcs,1Duvet Cover + 2Pillowcase,Plush Shaggy Duvet Cover Set, So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZbVZjUB6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fluffy & Soft: Ultimate cozy faux fur with faux rabbit fur on the surface and plush velvet on the reverse . This 100% polyester fluffy duvet cover throw uses zero animal products, yet recreates the appearance and thick pile of genuine rabbit fur, providing plenty of warmth and softness. Soft as A Cloud:This fluffy comforter cover set has a bunny-like softness that runs smoothly over skin,as light and soft as touching a cloud!Both sides are made of anti-pilling fabric, which will not decolorize after washing. More Durable: Compared with animal fur fading over time, faux fur duvet cover set with well-knit synthetic fibers will stay in greater condition for longer. You can enjoy these kinds of furry throw comforter for years without noticing a difference in appearance. Best Gift:This plush shaggy duvet cover set is a very special、uxury and also practical gift for your family、lover and friends in festival, chilly days and any special occasions.Twin/Queen/King for you to choose and you can use our duvet cover to fit all of your family comforter. Easy Care: Turning it inside-out, machine wash with cold water cycle, gentle and low temperature drying.Do not bleach, do not Iron. We recommend cleaning before the first use because it reduces the product's cutting debris and is more skin friendly. Due to the special nature of the product, it is recommended to use after shaking and it will be more fluffy. AFTER-SALES SERVICE： In case you have any questions, please contact us and we will resolve within 24 hours to your full satisfaction. We provide the most satisfactory after-sales service for every customer. We believe that making every customer happy is the key for us to get better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZbVZjUB6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULUSERN","source_asin":"B09HZ56S26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZ56S26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZ56S26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
