window.products.push({"id":1049670,"name":"Dean Crouser Peewee Hummingbird Watercolor Red 14 x 7 Ceramic Stoneware Carving Serving Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fqzmuGrWL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"When you enjoy the natural beauty of the great outdoors, it makes sense to bring it into your home. Decorate your space with accent pieces and functional dishware from the Big Sky Collection. Watercolor artist, Dean Crouser, brings a unique look to everyday flora and fauna with his vibrant artwork created especially for this Collection. His work is all inspired by a love of nature and a childhood spent camping in the Pacific Northwest. When you have guests over, serve them tasty treats from the DEMDACO Dean Crouser PeeWee Hummingbird Serving Board. This petite Serving dish shows a small hummingbird painted in a rainbow of blue, green, and red colors about to land on the head of an echinacea plant. The other side features instructions for laying out the ultimate cheese plate. A perfect gift for nature lovers and fans of Dean Crouser, this Serving dish will have your loved ones oohing and aahing. You can also keep it for yourself to use on lazy summer evenings and at small Gatherings. This DEMDACO Dean Crouser PeeWee Hummingbird Serving Board is made from ceramic stoneware and comes with a leather tie for hanging. It measures 8\" W x 14\" L. Size: 7\"w x 14\"h Materials: stoneware Care Instructions: Not Intended for Microwave Use, Dishwasher Safe Copyright: © 2018 Dean Crouser for DEMDACO UPC: 638713491213","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fqzmuGrWL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B07MZDN3GJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZDN3GJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZDN3GJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
