window.products.push({"id":1049710,"name":"Safari Ltd Zoo Babies Bulk Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814cFpq7LGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Take a trip to the zoo and encounter little bundles of joy with our zoo babies Bulk Bags! Create your own mini petting zoo with our adorable figures. History:Play with a baby chimpanzee or little giraffe! Each baby animal has different characteristics. For example, tiger cubs stay with their mothers for around 3 years, while alligators only stay with their young for about a year. Characteristics:ÂThis 48 piece set contains 11 unique figures of super cute baby zoo animals, including baby zebra foals, tiger cubs, hippo babies, rhino babies, giraffe calves, polar bear cubs, panda cubs, elephant calves, chimpanzee babies, gorilla babies, and alligator babies.Â Size and Color:ÂBulk Bags measure 8 inches by 7.5 inches. The figures within range from 1.25 inches to 3.75 inches. All of our products are Non-toxic and BPA free 48 Pieces Per Bag. Contents Cannot Be Purchased Individually. Note - Bulk Bags will include at least one of every unique figure, but total number of each figure in Bulk Bag may vary. From the Manufacturer Play is the essential joy of childhood. Through play children learn about themselves, their environment and the larger world. At Safari Ltd. We design toys that assist the joy of play. In a highly technical world, the most endangered species is the imagination. Perhaps we should spell that with a capital \"I\". Without imagination, the individual loses the creative spark. We intend to never let that happen. We hope your child will enjoy many hours of creative play with this cute little Zoo Babies in a bag. Themed collections in 48 piece. bulk bags, based on popular demand of our most outstanding Toob replicas. Replica Size: 1.5\" to 3\" H [4 to 7.5 cm].","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814cFpq7LGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safari Ltd.","source_asin":"B006HEIMBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006HEIMBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006HEIMBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
