window.products.push({"id":1049938,"name":"HATAK Silicone Slow Cooker Liner, Reusable Slow Cooker Silicone Liner, Suitable for Microwave, Oven, 6-7 Quart Oval Slow Cooker (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VyuNiO8rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CONVENIENT AND PRACTICAL --- Make your slow cooker more convenient and practical, the lining is strong and easy to insert and stand independently, no need to worry about cooking utensils cleaning. Please cook in hot water for 5 minutes when using silicone products for the first time ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY AND REUSABLE --- Our silicone slow cooker liner is made of food-grade silicone material, heat-resistant up to 446 degrees Fahrenheit Reusable, environmentally friendly, and free of harmful substances, making your cooking more at ease. PROTECT THE CERAMIC---It can effectively prevent sticky food residue, scratches, and cracks, prolong the life of the slow cooker, and never burnt food again. EASY TO CLEAN --- No more need to wash heavy ceramics, just wash the slow cooker silicone liner with warm water, and you can easily complete the cookware cleaning task. GREAT GIFT CHOICE---reusable slow cooker silicone liner is a great gift for family and friends, easy to use and replace so that they can also enjoy a more convenient cooking experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VyuNiO8rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HATAK","source_asin":"B0C164MTT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C164MTT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C164MTT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1049939,"name":"Egg Cups For Soft Boiled Eggs, Soft Boiled Egg Holder, Egg Topper - Includes 2 Egg Cups, 2 Metal Spoons & 1 Soft Boiled Egg Cutter or Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YWNhBpH9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you thinking of ways to make breakfast extra special? People consider breakfast the most important meal of the day. Eggs are a breakfast staple everywhere, and they’re the best when they’re fresh. However, despite the multitude of options on how to serve eggs, some people might find them plain or bland. Egg dishes might seem too simple to serve, but try pairing them with dainty cups and spoons. You and your family or guests are sure to get an entirely different experience, what with all the fancy egg cracking, as well as scooping from sleek holders with pretty scoopers. This Egg Topper Set by Shop Square can elevate the way you serve eggs for breakfast! First, put soft-boiled eggs on the cups. Use the topper to cut the tops of the eggs without leaving bits of eggshells behind. Just hold the ball handle, pull it, and then release it. Use the spoons to scoop the eggs or serve them with pieces of toast to be dipped in the delicious yolk. This 5-piece breakfast set is made from durable metal with a shiny finish. The box contains 2 cups, 2 spoons, and 1 egg topper. Because it’s both functional and stylish, the bundle makes a wonderful gift for food enthusiasts! When not in use, this egg topper set can be used as European-inspired accent pieces. Arrange them on your breakfast counter, or display them on your kitchen shelf. The stainless finish gives them an elegant look, so they can easily become conversation pieces during breakfast meetings or simple gatherings of family and friends. Here are more reasons to love this egg cracker topper set: - A classy present for birthdays, Christmas, and housewarming - The cups can be used to hold sauces and sweet treats - Smooth surface that’s easy to clean and maintain Make breakfast something to look forward to. Add the Shop Square Egg Cracker Topper Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YWNhBpH9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shop Square","source_asin":"B09PC71MFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1049939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PC71MFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PC71MFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
